  "releaseNotes": "New:\n      - Added support for Firmware 5 (Register Layout 20)\n      Bug:\n      - Occasional StreamOutOfData error occurring at the end of Trajectory Streaming when using extensions.\n      - Addresses Trajectory Streaming not reporting streaming failures occurring after the last Move command was processed successfully.\n      - Eliminated periodic 100 ms setpoint jumps during trajectory streaming caused by floating-point precision errors in the feed control interval.",
